// Compatibility rollout: retain legacy translation for a missing new summary.
// The explicit strict-mode run still diagnoses the unresolved contract.
// A passing positive run is compilation/placement evidence, not a device or
// whole-function safety certificate. The original non-sync body is unchanged.
// RUN: ptoas --pto-arch=a3 --pto-level=level3 --enable-insert-sync %s | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=EMITC
// REJECT: InsertSync unsupported effect: resource or memory operand is not modeled
// RUN: not ptoas --pto-arch=a3 --pto-level=level3 --enable-insert-sync --insert-sync-effect-coverage=strict %s -o /dev/null 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=REJECT
